tms 1
title Netherworld Tea Party
mood a stately waltz in a garden where the guests are not quite alive
author Claude (original)
tempo 104
loop yes

; Three beats to the bar (six eighths). E minor, then a lift to G. An FM pluck plays the tune like a koto,
; the bass takes beat one, a thin pulse plays the "pah-pah" on beats two and three.
channel lead  inst=fm-pluck pan=-0.15 gain=0.90
channel stab  inst=thin     pan=0.35  gain=0.55
channel pad   inst=fm-pad   pan=0.00  gain=0.55
channel bass  inst=bass     pan=0.00  gain=0.95
channel drums inst=hat      pan=0.10  gain=0.55

